  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c83a295a7a37ea945b7bf5559f6db0f7, type: 3}
  m_Name: ThursdayCubertAlive
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteWritings
  writing: 'Hey, so I saw that Dubert is still here... wasn''t she supposed to be
    picked up yesterday? Where is her owner?! She''s so irresponsible!


    Mubert
    looked angry and ate a lot, but did you leave some food in the kitchen? When
    I was taking care of them, Hubert was in the kitchen eating our food. Please
    clean up before you end your shift.


    P.S. If Dubert is still here at night,
    kick her out!


    - The Owner

'
